{"id":401,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"When the trees take on new hues, more of these Pokémon appear. The tone they create by striking their antennae together resembles that of the marimba, an instrument of foreign lands."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"It chats with others using the sounds of its colliding antennae. These sounds are fall hallmarks."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It shakes its head back to front, causing its antennae to hit each other and sound like a xylophone."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."},{"name":"Run Away","hidden":true,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":401,"name":"Kricketot","condition":null,"children":[{"id":402,"name":"Kricketune","condition":"Lv. 10","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[6,522],[16,450]],"machine":[450,283,679,806,522,851],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"swsh12pt5-10","name":"Kricketot","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Common","number":"10","artist":"Shigenori Negishi","img":"swsh12pt5/10"},{"id":"swsh10-9","name":"Kricketot","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Common","number":"9","artist":"Masakazu Fukuda","img":"swsh10/9"},{"id":"sm12-13","name":"Kricketot","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"13","artist":"Ken Sugimori","img":"sm12/13"},{"id":"xy9-5","name":"Kricketot","set":"BREAKpoint